+     * Rejects an owner whose required fields are missing (null) or blank (empty or whitespace only).
+     * Bean Validation already covers the {@code null} case and the fields constrained by a pattern,
+     * but a whitespace-only {@code address} or {@code city} satisfies the generated {@code @Size}
